00:17:24.100 --> 00:17:25.860
Yay, Trunks! Good call!

00:17:25.980 --> 00:17:27.420
What a smart boy you are.

00:17:27.560 --> 00:17:29.780
You're a real genius, just like your mom.

00:17:30.890 --> 00:17:32.770
