00:17:54.100 --> 00:17:56.120
any farther away, and it won't work.

00:17:56.380 --> 00:17:58.600
Huh, uh, 10 meters?

00:18:00.320 --> 00:18:02.900
Gee, don't you think that's kind of close?

00:18:03.570 --> 00:18:06.850
Don't complain. You're lucky you have that thing at all.

00:18:07.010 --> 00:18:11.810
Yeah, of course. I'll try to keep that in mind.

00:18:12.720 --> 00:18:13.680
Well, you better.

00:18:15.390 --> 00:18:16.630
Hey, what have you got there?

00:18:16.900 --> 00:18:19.840
