00:21:18.570 --> 00:21:21.230
I heard strange sounds coming from inside the chamber.

00:21:21.570 --> 00:21:22.870
I believe their time is up.

00:22:07.930 --> 00:22:11.270
At long last, the moment of truth has arrived.

00:22:12.020 --> 00:22:14.080
After a year of unseen training,

00:22:14.610 --> 00:22:18.130
Trunks and Vegeta have emerged from the hyperbolic time chamber.

00:22:18.830 --> 00:22:22.780
But do these hardened Saiyans possess the strength necessary

00:22:22.780 --> 00:22:26.140
to defeat the most terrible villain ever to threaten the Earth?

